# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "What we have obtained from the quantum computer are the individual matrix elements of $\\tilde{S}$ and the commuting Pauli groups that make up the matrix elements of $\\tilde{H}$. These terms must be combined to recover our matrices, so that we can solve the generalized eigenvalue problem.\n"
